        "name": "USN-8198-2",
        "description": "USN-8198-1 fixed vulnerabilities in Tornado. This update provides the corresponding updates for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that Tornado incorrectly handled parsing of large  multipart request bodies. An attacker could possibly use this issue to  cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-31958)   It was discovered that Tornado did not properly validate characters in  cookie values. An attacker could possibly use this issue to inject  arbitrary cookie attributes. (CVE-2026-35536)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-31958",
          "CVE-2026-35536"
        ]
      },
